    },
    "That approval does not match this lock and your partner’s key. Ask your partner to sign the release code shown here." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "هذه الموافقة لا تطابق هذا القفل ومفتاح شريكك. اطلب من شريكك توقيع رمز الإنهاء الظاهر هنا."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That is %lld words; the limit is %lld. Past that nobody remembers what is on the list, and a surprising block looks like a broken app." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "هذه %1$lld كلمة، والحد الأقصى %2$lld. بعد ذلك لا يتذكر أحد ما في القائمة، ويبدو الحجب المفاجئ كأنه عطل في التطبيق."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "That is %1$lld words; the limit is %2$lld. Past that nobody remembers what is on the list, and a surprising block looks like a broken app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That is not a partner key. It should be the code your partner’s Hisn Partner page shows under “Your key”." : {
